# Solo Main-Branch Workflow

This is a single-maintainer project. Prefer the simplest git flow.

## Branching

- Work and commit directly on `main` by default.
- Do **not** create a feature branch for each change unless the user asks for one.
- Do not open pull requests unless explicitly asked.

## When a branch already exists

If work is already on a feature branch, finish it there, then merge into `main` locally. Do not leave completed work stranded on a side branch.

## Pushing

Do not push unless the user asks to push.
